      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَطِمٌ</span></b>  A thing (Msb) <i>breaking in pieces of itself.</i>
(S, Msb, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  (assumed tropical:)  A horse <i>broken by age:</i> (S:)
